    "These are fixed-checkpoint inference interventions, not separately trained retrieval ablations.",
    "Recent and random controls change selection while retaining candidate-similarity ordering; repeated history items are retained.",
    "Mask0 does not remove the original SID-history KV cache and is not a completely history-free model.",
    "Per-seed paired confidence intervals describe paired users at a fixed checkpoint; across-seed sample standard deviations are reported separately.",
