    "The sim10-versus-recent10 fusion gain is consistently positive but small; this summary does not establish a large practical advantage.",
    "The test set and existing known split overlap were preserved; no new split deduplication or test-based parameter selection was performed.",
    "Source report JSON hashes and report bindings were rechecked during summarization; large H5 exports, checkpoints and full bootstrap calculations were not rerun.",
